  "title": "Baked Stuffed Shrimp with Crackers",
  "description": "A seasoned bread stuffing transforms jumbo shrimp into a gorgeous and richly flavored main dish or appetizer.",
  "authors": [
    "Lucille Rock Wilcox"
  ],
